    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radical Zomboarding is a roguelike snowboarding game that's all about shredding powder and shooting zombies. Do tricks, buy perks, build your loadout, speed through the snow, and soak the slopes with blood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.poster.avif?t=1742859643\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.webm?t=1742859643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.mp4?t=1742859643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like going fast? Getting big air? Shooting zombies? <i>Unhinged loading screen tips?</i> <strong>Radical Zomboarding</strong> has it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode: Roguelike snowboarding where you buy perks, shoot zombies, dodge missiles, complete challenges, and survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen mode: No zombies, no timers, no missiles, no stress! Just enjoy going down the slope at your own pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode: Complete a run with a specific set of rules and perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of unlockable characters, boards, and hats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New slopes that will push your zomboarding skills to the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic cheat codes like the ones you used to play with as a kid!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>And yes, it runs on the Steam Deck!</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radical Zomboarding is a roguelike snowboarding game that's all about shredding powder and shooting zombies. Do tricks, buy perks, build your loadout, speed through the snow, and soak the slopes with blood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.poster.avif?t=1742859643\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.webm?t=1742859643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547020/extras/8c6e478d44dbf382b80416c3d8be748e.mp4?t=1742859643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like going fast? Getting big air? Shooting zombies? <i>Unhinged loading screen tips?</i> <strong>Radical Zomboarding</strong> has it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic mode: Roguelike snowboarding where you buy perks, shoot zombies, dodge missiles, complete challenges, and survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zen mode: No zombies, no timers, no missiles, no stress! Just enjoy going down the slope at your own pace!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode: Complete a run with a specific set of rules and perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of unlockable characters, boards, and hats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New slopes that will push your zomboarding skills to the limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic cheat codes like the ones you used to play with as a kid!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>And yes, it runs on the Steam Deck!</strong></i></p>",
